    thinking: "**Reviewing App Integration**\n\nI\'m now diving into `src/App.tsx`. I\'m focusing on how the application integrates core functionalities. Specifically, I\'m examining the state management for documents, initialized with `DEFAULT_COMPANY_DOCUMENTS` and persisted via `localStorage`, as well as how `selectedDocIds` (document IDs enabled for queries) is handled. I need to make sure the connection is robust.\n\n\n**Analyzing App Components**\n\nI\'ve shifted my attention to the core application components. I\'m looking at state management for the user interface elements like modal visibility (`isKbOpen`, `isAddDocOpen`, `isGapLogOpen`) and loading states (`isSearching`). I\'m now exploring how the application handles the conversation history (`messages`), citation jumps, and grounding modes. I\'m also examining the empty state banner, thinking about how it presents the knowledge base\'s contents and available actions. Specifically, I\'m analyzing the initial structure of the input bar.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
